Changes: https://github.com/torchiaf/rancher-ai-agent/tree/feature-autocomplete 
  - added autocomplete endpoint: returns completions from user context + user prompt + previous messages, it's stoppable 
  - added summary endpoint: returns summary from a chat history - used to assign a Chat title 
  - store chats and messages in the Redis cache for faster access 
  - support chat_id when connecting to the WebSocket - to resume an old chat

DB 
  - align Redis cache <-> MySQL storage 

Rest API
  - expose rest endpoints for the UI extensions - messages and chats to show the list of chats and resume and old chat 


Dev notes:

- Rancher, docker installation (use your local-ip as hostname at first access):

  docker run -d --restart=unless-stopped -p 80:80 -p 443:443 -e CATTLE_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD=asd -e CATTLE_PASSWORD_MIN_LENGTH=3 --name rancher-head --privileged rancher/rancher:head

- AI assistant Helm install chart/agent - autocomplet endpoint + history support
  
  git remote add torchiaf git@github.com:torchiaf/rancher-ai-agent.git
  git fetch torchiaf feature-autocomplete
  git checkout -b feature-autocomplete torchiaf/feature-autocomplete

  kubectl create namespace cattle-ai-agent-system

  helm install ai-agent chart/agent \
  --namespace cattle-ai-agent-system \
  --create-namespace \
  --set "imagePullSecrets[0].name=gh-secret" \
  --set googleApiKey=AIzaSyBlhdHzPR4ao61IHktpXuHJSUf0VCgUljk \
  --set ollamaUrl="" \
  --set llmModel=gemini-2.0-flash \
  --set insecureSkipTls=true \
  --set activeLlm=gemini \
  --set log.level=debug

